# 🔎 Threat Hunting Portfolio

## Overview

Welcome to my Threat Hunting Portfolio! This repository documents hands-on cybersecurity investigations conducted in a simulated enterprise environment.

These investigations focus on identifying suspicious activity, analyzing endpoint and network telemetry, investigating potential security incidents, and mapping attacker behavior to the MITRE ATT&CK framework.

Each threat hunt includes the investigation methodology, queries used, evidence collected, findings, and recommended remediation or response actions.

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies

- Microsoft Defender for Endpoint (MDE)
- Microsoft Sentinel
- Kusto Query Language (KQL)
- Microsoft Azure
- Windows Event Logs
- MITRE ATT&CK Framework

